WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Set your station. Helmet on. Tee in front. Clear the hitting area.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Make smooth contact. Send the ball toward the net with a controlled swing.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Balance, then reset. Finish balanced. Reset before the next ball.

